pan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Since Patch #7, this armour can be found worn by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/38px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/50px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/25px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel\" title=\"Lae'zel\">Lae'zel</a> in the cage after the crash of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a>, if she was stripped of her personal armour in the <a href=\"/wiki/Prologue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Prologue\">Prologue</a>. Her original armour must not be in her inventory or she will requip it instead of having this armour.\n</p>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t<li class=\"gallerycaption\">Models</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 98.666666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 96.666666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hide_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Hide_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp/145px-Hide_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Hide_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp/217px-Hide_Armour_Human_Front_Model.webp 1.5